duce body fat, usually between longer bulking phases.[1] A Grokipedia summary describes them as lasting about 2 to 6 weeks.[1]","The same source says mini-cuts typically produce a few pounds of weight loss, much of it water and glycogen, and about 1 to 2 percent body fat reduction, with higher risks of muscle loss, fatigue and metabolic slowdown than a gradual cut.[1] Wikipedia notes that larger deficits cause faster weight loss but a greater risk of losing muscle.[2]","No clinical studies on mini-cuts were found."],"infobox":[["Type","Short cutting phase"],["Typical length","About 2-6 weeks (one summary)[1]"],["Related","Cutting, bulking"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Cutting is eating in a net negative energy balance to lose fat while preserving muscle.[2] A mini-cut compresses this into a shorter, steeper deficit.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Reported effects and risks","paras":["A Grokipedia summary reports most early weight lost is water and glycogen, with modest fat reduction, and cites greater risks of muscle loss, fatigue and metabolic slowdown.[1] It recommends more gradual loss for most people.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Cutting (bodybuilding)","url":"https://grokipedia.com/page/Cutting_(bodybuilding)","source":"Grokipedia","year":null,"type":"encyclopedia"},{"title":"Bodybuilding","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bodybuilding","source":"Wikipedia","year":null,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"The Flame-Free Confession Thread II","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/the-flame-free-confession-thread-ii/248113","site":"T Nation · 9998 posts · 2018"},{"title":"More Trouble Than I Am Worth: Chaos Is The Plan (T3hPwnisher Log)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/more-trouble-than-i-am-worth-chaos-is-the-plan-t3hpwnisher-log/276232","site":"T Nation · 8674 posts · 2021"},{"title":"Weird, but impressive","url":"https://t-nation.com/t